+/* Prove equivalence of modes.
+   Copyright (C) 2001-2023 J. Marcel van der Veer.
+   Copyright (C) 2025 Jose E. Marchesi.
+
+   Original implementation by J. Marcel van der Veer.
+   Adapted for GCC by Jose E. Marchesi.
