+
+@deftypefn Operator {} {**} {= (@B{l} @B{real} a, @B{int} b) @B{l} @B{real}}
+@deftypefnx Operator {} {^} {= (@B{l} @B{real} a, @B{int} b) @B{l} @B{real}}
