+@end deftypefn
+
+@deftypefn Operator {} {@B{gt}} {= (@B{l} @B{real} a, b) @B{bool}}
+@deftypefnx Operator {} {>} {= (@B{l} @B{real} a, b) @B{bool}}
+Dyadic operator that yields whether @code{a} is greater than
